coopplatformer (working title)

Everything in this game is made by its own code or by scripts in this folder. No image, model or sound is taken
from elsewhere, so there is nothing to attribute beyond the font and the engine.

Made by the game's own code (games/coopplatformer/*.c):
  - the level generator and its four regions
  - every texture: stone, grass, cave stone with crystal specks, sandstone brick, volcanic basalt with glowing seams,
    lava, water ripples, the sun glow and the clouds (value noise turned into albedo, normal, roughness, occlusion
    and emission maps at start-up)
  - the backdrop: sky, ridges, trees, columns, spires, crystals, mushrooms, grass and flowers (generated meshes)
  - every sound (synthesized at start-up)

Made by tools/gen-assets.mjs (our own script: value noise and curves, nothing downloaded):
  - assets/decals.png: the decal sheet (dirt, scorch, moss, cracks, damp streaks, leaf litter, soot, crazed ground)
  - assets/grade/*.cube: the colour grade of each region (3D lookup tables)

Made by tools/blender/characters.py (Blender 5.2, run headless, our own script, no downloaded assets):
  - assets/models/hero.glb, walker.glb, flyer.glb, boss.glb: skinned meshes with PBR materials. The game poses
    their bones in code, so there are no baked animations.

Fonts: the engine's built-in UI font (Fira Sans, SIL Open Font License 1.1, shipped with the engine).

Design reading (ideas only, no code or assets copied): public notes on platformer feel
(coyote time, jump buffering, apex gravity, short wall-jump grace), and the MetSys map-room notes (MIT).
